{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"共首函子"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"共首函子"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>共首函子 (initial functor) 是不改变"},{"Local":{"url":"极限","text":"极限"}},{"Plain":"的指标代换, 是"},{"Local":{"url":"共尾函子","text":"共尾函子"}},{"Plain":"的对偶概念.</p>\n"}]}}